  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\mathrm{x}^2-\\mathrm{y}^2+2 \\mathrm{y}=1 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{x}= \\pm(\\mathrm{y}-1)\\)\nBisectors of above line are \\(x=0 ~\\&~ y=1\\)\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/q9-e-nY41f9GD5ETl-tSN4Ed4dRtdgHVdnw95PKOA4k.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nSo area between \\(x=0, y=1 ~\\&~ x+y=3\\) is shaded Region shown in figure.<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/HlzbRdJnBytZmsPrh3LCzmrLogiaYjEvOdpefLciUfA.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nArea \\(=1 / 2 \\times 2 \\times 2=2\\) sq. units",
    "image": null
